usage: keel_wake_experiment.py [-h]
                               {freeze,capture-build,_revalidate-worker,prepare,run,approve,finalize-evidence} ...

Registered KeelWake stages. Preparation/approval is zero-game; no retries.
Source freeze and actual same-worker runtime approval are separate gates. Only
run() can start games, after complete admission and a create-only durable
receipt.

positional arguments:
  {freeze,capture-build,_revalidate-worker,prepare,run,approve,finalize-evidence}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
